@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
# With the https launch profile, use instead:
# @baseUrl = https://localhost:7080

# Seeded users for later endpoints:
# Alex Nguyen   00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
# Priya Sharma  00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
# Sam Taylor    00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
# Jordan Lee    00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
# Maria Garcia  00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

# Due dates in this file are in 2027 so they are not in the past (BR-2 refuses past
# due dates). Update them once 2027 has passed.
#
# Run the requests in order. The demo changes data (task 201 is edited, then
# completed, and GR-100001 is closed), so reset the database before running again
# (see README, "Reset the demo"). Task 201 must still be at version 1 for the edit.

### Login as Alex
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "Alex.Nguyen@Example.org " }

### Unknown email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody@example.org" }

### Blank email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "" }

### Unknown route
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### List grants (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### List open grants
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants?status=Open
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Grant detail (GR-100001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Add task to GR-100004 (fixed Idempotency-Key, so the replay below uses the same key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104/tasks
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Idempotency-Key: demo-add-call-applicant
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call applicant", "dueDate": "2027-06-30", "priority": "Low" }

### Replay of the same Add task (same key, same body): returns the same task, creates no duplicate
POST {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104/tasks
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Idempotency-Key: demo-add-call-applicant
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call applicant", "dueDate": "2027-06-30", "priority": "Low" }

### Close GR-100001 (refused while a High task is pending, BR-5)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101/close
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Overdue tasks (before the edit: "Verify bank details" and "Review progress report")
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/overdue
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Edit task "Verify bank details" (If-Match is version 1, the seeded version)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
If-Match: "1"
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Verify bank details", "dueDate": "2027-07-15", "priority": "High" }

### Complete task "Verify bank details" (after the edit; the task is now at version 2)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201/complete
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Close GR-100001 again: now succeeds, because no High task is pending
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101/close
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
